title: Wrong Door
text: A BLACK target wants darkness: if any light at all touches it, the level is not solved. Light passes through targets, so keep the beam well away from the dark one. Two doors lead through the wall; take the one nobody is guarding.
trick: a black target rules out the short way; the beam takes the longer route
motif: a wall with two doors, the near one guarded by a black target
---
